                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "127d1f6e-b696-3f1e-98b8-9d8ef682113e",
                        "entry_id": "73c4405f-d956-3758-804d-e28951252a3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A long march for training purposes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "abffe825-c8f4-44e3-984d-8f257a62c534",
                                "sense_id": "127d1f6e-b696-3f1e-98b8-9d8ef682113e",
                                "text": "Half of the unit was preparing for some training exercise, apparently a route-march carrying full kit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f93d6cce-21f7-451b-8391-5abdfb6f2f1f",
                                "sense_id": "127d1f6e-b696-3f1e-98b8-9d8ef682113e",
                                "text": "He then proceeded to lead them on a route-march at a blistering pace that many struggled to keep up with."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "23e19c95-ed47-4001-afa9-6b4d5a31bfcc",
                                "sense_id": "127d1f6e-b696-3f1e-98b8-9d8ef682113e",
                                "text": "We had been out on a route-march. You know, I daresay, that nowadays a route-march is not simply a matter of marching. In a route-march there is involved a certain amount of field training."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e495b5d2-9edb-42bc-8155-7fdc2e078142",
                                "sense_id": "127d1f6e-b696-3f1e-98b8-9d8ef682113e",
                                "text": "This young officer came up to me and asked me whether I would mind marching more slowly -- they were running out of puff. I thought I was supposed to go on a route-march and be back by a certain time."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f0b1c033-898a-30d4-b996-7c2a59cccc76",
                        "entry_id": "73c4405f-d956-3758-804d-e28951252a3f",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A long grueling walk."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly",
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "059e3bcf-f38f-436d-b635-e5a86475a410",
                                "sense_id": "f0b1c033-898a-30d4-b996-7c2a59cccc76",
                                "text": "Anna, she sensed, was the kind of indomitable woman who could go on a route-march for seven days and nights without sleeping."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
